## The Power of the Sensory "Aha!" Moment

Consumer gadget videos succeed when viewers experience an instinctive moment of sensory gratification:
- The audible snap of a magnetic charger locking into place.
- The effortless glide of an ergonomic peeler slicing a carrot.
- The instant transformation of a cluttered drawer into organized perfection.

Keep the setup tight: 2 seconds of pain, followed immediately by 5 seconds of satisfying mechanical triumph.
